data: {"node":"shelve","run":"861637ff85ec270adf20555fe637061b","text":"Reindex job failing every ten minutes since key rotation\n\nWhat is broken: the background reindex job has failed on every scheduled run since 08:00 UTC and is still failing.\n\nKnown cause: last night's key rotation stripped the job's service account of its permission.\n\nWhy it is not urgent: no user-facing page reads that index yet, so nobody is affected; only the index stays stale.\n\nBefore it can be closed: the service account's permission must be restored, one scheduled run must complete cleanly, and the index must confirm it is caught up."}

